    <rigor-reason>Adds a second thread topology (person-to-person, not record-anchored) with explicit two-participant membership over the shared `IThreadResolver` + thread model; touches `.cs` in `Services/Communication/`; FULL protocol + Step 9.5 gates.</rigor-reason>
