        `IThreadResolver` find-or-create branches on topology: record-anchored resolves by ancestry/ACS key + ADR-024 anchor; 1:1 resolves/creates a person-to-person thread keyed by the ordered participant pair.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Explicit membership (not derived)" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/ThreadMembershipDerivationService.cs">
        For 1:1, the derivation service returns the explicit two-party list rather than calling `IMembershipResolverService` — task 041's reconcile then projects exactly those two to ACS.
