  <notes>
    Depends on 040 (shared resolver). Parallel-safe with 041/042 after 040 lands, but it consumes 041's reconcile + 042's filter — coordinate if those land concurrently (they are the same `Services/Communication/` surface; `/conflict-check`).

    Strict scope: exactly two participants. If a use case seems to want three participants, that is the deferred N-party group topology — do NOT build it; note it for R2. The 1:1 thread is a thin topology over the existing thread machinery; if it seems to need a parallel pipeline, the resolver branch is mis-shaped — fix the branch.
  </notes>

